Business Rules / Invariants
BR1 — Only Verified Clubs Are Public
Only clubs whose registration has been approved shall be visible to ordinary university users.

BR2 — Club Must Have a Representative
Every registered club must have at least one designated club representative.

BR3 — Venue Cannot Be Double-Booked
A venue shall not have two approved bookings occupying overlapping dates and times.

BR4 — Only Approved Clubs Can Request Venues
A club must be verified before it can submit a venue or facility request.

BR5 — A Rejected Request Cannot Produce a Booking
A venue request with a rejected status shall not have an active/approved booking associated with it.

BR6 — Booking Must Match the Requested Activity
An approved booking must be associated with a valid club activity.

BR7 — Venue Capacity Must Be Sufficient
The capacity of the allocated venue must be greater than or equal to the expected number of attendees.

BR8 — Only Authorized Staff Can Approve Requests
Only authorized administrative staff may approve or reject club registrations and venue requests.
